      "created_at": "2024-07-04T17:12:16.278Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Apologies in advance it this topic has already been asked / discussed elsewhere (as neither searching here nor in google gave me any clue about it) , so here I go …</p>\n<p>I want to add a field “Last IP” as we see it in “User” Doctype in , say “Material Request” in ERPNext.</p>\n<p>I added that filed - exactly as it is in “User” - but did not get my IP registered as it does in User DT.</p>\n<p>What is being missed here ?</p>\n<p>Thank you.</p>",
